---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About TravellerAI — The Fair Travel Marketplace" 
  description="We empower independent guides, chalets, and transport fleets to run on their own terms, while providing travelers with transparent pricing and direct operator access."
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <span class="editorial-tag">Brand Manifesto</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">The architecture of trust in modern travel.</h1>
      
      <div class="prose-content">
        <p class="lead-p">
          Global travel booking has become monopolized by giant aggregator engines that demand exorbitant 25–35% commissions from local guides and family-run chalets, while obscuring direct contact and inflating traveler fees.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>TravellerAI was founded to dismantle that friction.</strong> We build unified open commerce infrastructure that lets independent operators showcase authentic high-altitude expeditions, secluded onsen ryokans, and executive transport fleets directly to global travelers.
        </p>

        <h2>The Core Pillars</h2>
        <div class="pillars-grid">
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <h3>Direct Operator Contact</h3>
            <p>Every itinerary is verified with the actual mountain guide, chalet host, or fleet dispatcher managing your departure.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <h3>Zero Commission Gouging</h3>
            <p>Providers keep their earnings. Fair, transparent flat software fees instead of predatory margin cuts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <h3>Architectural Precision</h3>
            <p>Swiss Modern discipline: zero decorative noise, high readability, and complete operational transparency.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Leadership & Governance</h2>
        <p>
          Headquartered globally with edge infrastructure deployed across distributed serverless regions. Maintained under strict engineering, safety, and payment security standards.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-top: var(--space-16);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-24);
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: var(--container-narrow);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: var(--text-hero);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .prose-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-graphite);
  }

  .lead-p {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .prose-content h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }

  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .pillar-card {
    background-color: var(--color-fog);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-stone);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .pillar-card h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  .pillar-card p {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
